#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:526
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"On Windows on ARM, the OpenGL that Cineo draws with comes from Microsoft's "
"OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Install or repair it from the "
"Microsoft Store, then open Cineo again.\n"
"\n"
"Details: {details}\n"
"\n"
"Open its Microsoft Store page?"
msgstr ""
"En Windows on ARM, el OpenGL con el que dibuja Cineo procede del paquete "
"OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack de Microsoft. Instálalo o "
"repáralo desde Microsoft Store y vuelve a abrir Cineo.\n"
"\n"
"Detalles: {details}\n"
"\n"
"¿Abrir su página en Microsoft Store?"

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:530
msgid ""
"Install your graphics card's driver, from its maker or from Windows Update, "
"then open Cineo again. Remote Desktop and virtual machines need 3D "
"acceleration turned on."
msgstr ""
"Instala el controlador de tu tarjeta gráfica, desde su fabricante o desde "
"Windows Update, y vuelve a abrir Cineo. Escritorio remoto y las máquinas "
"virtuales necesitan la aceleración 3D activada."

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:534
msgid ""
"Install your graphics card's driver or Mesa, then open Cineo again. Remote "
"sessions and virtual machines need 3D acceleration turned on."
msgstr ""
"Instala el controlador de tu tarjeta gráfica o Mesa y vuelve a abrir Cineo. "
"Las sesiones remotas y las máquinas virtuales necesitan la aceleración 3D "
"activada."

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:537
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Cineo needs your graphics driver to draw its window (OpenGL 2 or later), and "
"this computer only has basic graphics.\n"
"\n"
"{remedy}\n"
"\n"
"Details: {details}"
msgstr ""
"Cineo necesita el controlador gráfico para dibujar su ventana (OpenGL 2 o "
"posterior), y este equipo solo dispone de gráficos básicos.\n"
"\n"
"{remedy}\n"
"\n"
"Detalles: {details}"

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:540
